<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Taiwan financial stock basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Taiwan financial stock basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Wednesday it proposed to issue five million American-style U.S. dollar composite call warrants on a basket of Taiwan financial stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Development Corp	     2 shares</p>
<p> Fuh-Hwa Securities		   3 shares</p>
<p> First Bank			     1 share</p>
<p> China Trust			    3 share</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$22.70     PREMIUM	 13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$5.80	GEARING	 4.35X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  27.NOV.97    PAYDATE	 18.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    US$25.22     LISTING DATE  18.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
